# UPGRADE-20
# Autonomous Software Engineering Loop
#
# Issue / Task Intake
# Durable Execution Plan
# Isolated Git Worktrees
# Local Coding
# Validation
# Independent Review
# Bounded Repair
# Security Gate
# Commit
# Pull Request
# Resume / Cancel / Retry
# Crash Recovery
#
# PRIMARY PRINCIPLES:
#
# NO-COST FIRST
# LOCAL-FIRST
# ISOLATED WORKTREE
# BASELINE BEFORE EDIT
# TESTS BEFORE CLAIMS
# BOUNDED SELF-CORRECTION
# HUMAN APPROVAL FOR HIGH-RISK MUTATIONS
# NO SILENT PUSH / MERGE
# NO SILENT PAID FALLBACK
# NO FABRICATED SUCCESS

You are operating directly inside ZCoder after Upgrade-19.

================================================================
MISSION
================================================================

Upgrade-19 reportedly introduced:

- repository stack detection
- package-manager discovery
- validation discovery
- AGENTS.md generation
- project bootstrap
- project readiness
- local RAG bootstrap
- local/no-cost execution policy

Upgrade-20 must combine all previous platform components into a complete
software-engineering execution loop.

Target:

TASK / ISSUE
    │
    ▼
Project Readiness
    │
    ▼
Baseline
    │
    ▼
Execution Plan
    │
    ▼
Isolated Worktree
    │
    ▼
Repository Analysis / RAG
    │
    ▼
Local Coding Agent
    │
    ▼
Validation
    │
    ├── PASS ────────────────┐
    │                        │
    └── FAIL                 │
         │                   │
         ▼                   │
    Diagnosis                │
         │                   │
         ▼                   │
    Bounded Repair           │
         │                   │
         └────► Validation ──┘
                              │
                              ▼
                       Independent Review
                              │
                              ▼
                         Security Gate
                              │
                              ▼
                           Final Diff
                              │
                    ┌─────────┴─────────┐
                    ▼                   ▼
                 Commit              Report
                    │
                    ▼
            Optional Push / PR
                    │
                    ▼
                CI Observe
                    │
                    ▼
             Bounded CI Repair
                    │
                    ▼
              Merge Readiness

All durable.

All resumable.

All auditable.

No paid provider required for CORE_FREE.

