================================================================
186. TEST EXPANSION
================================================================

Do NOT add another 3-test upgrade.

Create substantial tests across separate modules.

Minimum categories:

task lifecycle
worktree
baseline
plan
edit
validation
repair
review
security
checkpoint/recovery
Git
GitHub fake
approval
concurrency
offline
zero paid

Aim for behavioral coverage, not arbitrary test count.

