================================================================

Make no-cost autonomous engineering visible:

cd repo

zcoder init
zcoder init --apply

zcoder run "Fix the failing tests"

Then optionally:

zcoder run "Fix issue #42" --pr

Paid model credentials must not be first-run requirement.

