================================================================

Run:

python -m pytest -q -ra
python main.py --version
python -m build

clean wheel install

zcoder --version
zcoder run --help
zcoder jobs --help

git diff --check
git status --short

Run separately:

project bootstrap regression
worktree suite
validation suite
repair suite
review/security suite
checkpoint/recovery suite
concurrency suite
offline autonomous E2E
zero-paid autonomous E2E
FakeGitHub PR/CI E2E
self-hosted Web profile

If available:

real local model engineering E2E
real GitHub sandbox E2E

Never fabricate them.

================================================================
203. DEFINITION OF DONE
================================================================

Upgrade-20 is complete only when:

[ ] Upgrade-19 missing gates are re-audited
[ ] validation states are semantically correct
[ ] readiness dimensions are explicit
[ ] task domain is durable
[ ] attempts preserve history
[ ] baseline occurs before edits
[ ] dirty primary repo is protected
[ ] isolated worktrees are default
[ ] worktree ownership is safe
[ ] worktree path escape is blocked
[ ] exact base commit is recorded
[ ] plan is versioned
[ ] project context is bounded
[ ] structured editing stays inside workspace
[ ] every command uses policy
[ ] validation profiles come from project evidence
[ ] baseline/post-edit failures are differentiated
[ ] required final validators govern success
[ ] repair loop is bounded
[ ] no-progress detection exists
[ ] checkpoints survive crash
[ ] resume is idempotent
[ ] cancellation is safe
[ ] retry creates correct attempt semantics
[ ] deterministic review exists
[ ] security hard failures block completion
[ ] final validation runs after repair/review
[ ] commit has strict preconditions
[ ] remote push requires explicit policy
[ ] force push defaults denied
[ ] PR creation is idempotent
[ ] CI repair is bounded
[ ] workflow/security mutations are elevated risk
[ ] approvals bind exact action/state
[ ] stale worker cannot perform external mutation
[ ] GitHub remains optional
[ ] local Git autonomous engineering works offline
[ ] zero-cost autonomous E2E performs 0 paid calls
[ ] tests substantially cover runtime behavior
[ ] inherited tenant/RLS/local-runtime/quality gates remain green

